WEBVTT

00:02:27.417 --> 00:02:31.434
And I've done human rights work
across four continents.

00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:33.393
And what I've learned is this:

00:02:33.417 --> 00:02:36.726
that if we want to do
something about racism,

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:40.726
we have to first understand what it is.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:43.601
So let's talk about
this thing called race.

00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:46.000
What exactly is it?

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:48.976
A fact of our lives?

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.893
One of the most powerful
forces in the world?

00:02:51.917 --> 00:02:55.351
Something we don't particularly
want to talk about?

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:57.684
It is all these things,

00:02:57.708 --> 00:03:00.393
but it is something else.